  "question": "Within 180 kilometers of Go Fish, Rosedale, MD, where can I find a gallery toward Fairfield Inn & Suites by Marriott Harrisburg International Airport, Middletown, PA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.48474 39.339761)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.759816 40.1973)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.48474 39.339761)',4326)::geography, 180000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.48474 39.339761)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
